stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> matched: Agent 2 (coverage ≥ 80%)
    matched --> drafting: Agent 3
    drafting --> qa_failed: lint fails
    drafting --> pending_approval: lint passes
    qa_failed --> drafting: retry with template only
    pending_approval --> approved: recruiter approves
    pending_approval --> rejected: recruiter rejects
    pending_approval --> skipped: recruiter skips
    pending_approval --> expired: job closed, or 14 days old
    approved --> sending: Agent 4 re-check passes
    approved --> cancelled: re-check fails (job closed, opted out)
    sending --> sent: provider accepted
    sending --> failed: provider error
    failed --> sending: retry (max 3)
    failed --> dead: retries used up
    sent --> bounced: SES bounce
    sent --> unsubscribed: link clicked
    rejected --> [*]
    skipped --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    dead --> [*]
    bounced --> [*]
    unsubscribed --> [*]
